# Prompt Library — {{ project_name }}

Versioned prompts for repeatable Claude Code tasks on this project.
Treat these as artifacts — commit changes, don't edit in place.

## Why Version Prompts?

Prompts drift. Models update. A prompt that worked last month may not work today.
Versioning lets you catch regressions and A/B test variations.

## Naming Convention

`[task]-v[N].md`
e.g., `code-review-v1.md`, `refactor-v2.md`

## Using a Prompt

Reference the prompt file explicitly in your Claude Code session:

```
Load tools/prompts/code-review-v1.md and run it against the following diff: [paste diff]
```

